          "description": "----------\n{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.description}}\n\n----------\n\n### Links\n{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.id %} | [Link to SIEM Rule](https://kibana.whitesector.inf.elasticnet.co/s/infosec-detections/app/siem#/detections/rules/id/{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.id}}){% endif %}{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.event.reference %} | [Link to Alert]({{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.event.reference}}){% endif %}{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.labels.endpoint_id %} | [Link to Endpoint](https://thunderbolt.inf.elasticnet.co/endpoints/{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.labels.endpoint_id}}){% endif %} |\n\n\n### References\n{% assign references = .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.references | split: \",\" %}\n{% for url in references %}\n- {{url}}\n\n{% endfor %} \n\n\n{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.false_positives != empty %}\n### False Positive Notes\n```\n{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.false_positives}}\n```\n{% endif %}\n\n\n{% if .query_misp.misp_lookup_result != \"None\" %}\n### MISP Hits\n*A match for `{{.extract_artifacts.sha256}}` was found in MISP!*\n\n[{{.query_misp.misp_lookup_result.info}}](https://misp-app.inf.elasticnet.co/events/view/{{.query_misp.misp_lookup_result.id}})\n{% endif %}\n\n\n### Additional Context\n----------\n{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.host.name %}{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.host.name | prepend: \"Hostname: `\" | append: \"`\"}}{% endif %}\n\n{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.host.os.name %}{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.host.os.name | prepend: \"Host OS: `\" | append: \"`\"}}{% endif %}\n\n{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.process.executable %}{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.process.executable | prepend: \"Executable: `\" | append: \"`\"}}{% endif %}\n\n{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.process.args %}{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.process.args | prepend: \"Args: `\" | append: \"`\"}}{% endif %}\n\n{% if .explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.process.command_line %}{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.process.command_line  | prepend: \"Command Line: `\" | append: \"`\"}}{% endif %}\n\nSignal Risk Score: `{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.risk_score}}`\n\nSignal Severity: `{{.explode_array_of_alerts.individual_record.signal.rule.severity}}`\n\n----------",
